even if you love them, don't eat too much at once

285
00:11:02,795 --> 00:11:03,396
I know

286
00:11:03,396 --> 00:11:05,064
Just the right amount is best

287
00:11:09,936 --> 00:11:11,471
It's time for today's

288
00:11:11,471 --> 00:11:13,273
Food Facts!

289
00:11:17,744 --> 00:11:19,078
Oysters are a type of shellfish

290
00:11:19,078 --> 00:11:21,214
Because of their white appearance and rich nutrients,

291
00:11:21,214 --> 00:11:23,149
they're also called the milk of the sea

292
00:11:23,149 --> 00:11:24,150
Got it!

293
00:11:24,150 --> 00:11:25,885
Oyster shells can be ground into powder

294
00:11:25,885 --> 00:11:27,887
and processed into fertilizer

295
00:11:27,887 --> 00:11:29,756
to help plants grow strong and healthy

296
00:11:29,756 --> 00:11:30,557
Cool!

297
00:11:31,090 --> 00:11:32,959
I want to learn more!

298
00:11:32,959 --> 00:11:33,826
No problem!

299
00:11:34,627 --> 00:11:35,895
The chewy texture of oyster omelets

300
00:11:35,895 --> 00:11:37,697
comes from sweet potato starch or tapioca starch

301
00:11:37,697 --> 00:11:39,699
Egg omelets, shrimp omelets, cuttlefish omelets,

302
00:11:39,699 --> 00:11:40,833
and others are all related dishes

303
00:11:41,701 --> 00:11:43,303
Legend says oyster omelets were invented

304
00:11:43,303 --> 00:11:45,638
when food ran short during a battle by the sea

305
00:11:45,638 --> 00:11:47,907
People used whatever ingredients they could find to make a dish that would feed the soldiers

306
00:11:49,175 --> 00:11:51,444
I love delicious food!

307
00:11:58,651 --> 00:12:00,653
Beelu's Food Adventure

308
00:12:00,653 --> 00:12:02,522
See you next time!
